# Longsword at microcube resolution (1 microcube = 1/9 unit)
# Blade is 1 microcube thick — items held in hands must be skinny.
# Origin at grip base; extends up (+Y). Total ~1.45 units tall.
# M px py pz sx sy sz mx my mz Material

# Grip (Wood), X=4 Z=4, Y=0..2
M 0 0 0 1 0 1 1 0 1 Wood
M 0 0 0 1 0 1 1 1 1 Wood
M 0 0 0 1 0 1 1 2 1 Wood

# Crossguard (Metal), Y=3, X=2..6, Z=4
M 0 0 0 0 1 1 2 0 1 Metal
M 0 0 0 1 1 1 0 0 1 Metal
M 0 0 0 1 1 1 1 0 1 Metal
M 0 0 0 1 1 1 2 0 1 Metal
M 0 0 0 2 1 1 0 0 1 Metal

# Blade (Metal), X=4 Z=4, Y=4..12
M 0 0 0 1 1 1 1 1 1 Metal
M 0 0 0 1 1 1 1 2 1 Metal
M 0 0 0 1 2 1 1 0 1 Metal
M 0 0 0 1 2 1 1 1 1 Metal
M 0 0 0 1 2 1 1 2 1 Metal
M 0 1 0 1 0 1 1 0 1 Metal
M 0 1 0 1 0 1 1 1 1 Metal
M 0 1 0 1 0 1 1 2 1 Metal

# Tip
M 0 1 0 1 1 1 1 0 1 Metal
